DOMAIN-KEYWORD,anthropic,HP_Home
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,claude,HP_Home
IP-CIDR,160.79.104.0/21,HP_Home,no-resolve
IP-ASN,399358,HP_Home,no-resolve

